                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "irretrievably",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "44d4636a-d038-3d37-8f4e-14da2a062fa0",
                                        "entry_id": "fb30856a-c9b9-3869-9d25-ba5fcc39a00c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In an irretrievable manner; irrecoverably."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "473d014d-a9d9-4300-868b-a88f58133be5",
                                                "sense_id": "44d4636a-d038-3d37-8f4e-14da2a062fa0",
                                                "text": "Old English seems, and remains, irretrievably distant[.]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98aef596-53ff-48ba-bd0e-a1b3dfb48796",
                                                "sense_id": "44d4636a-d038-3d37-8f4e-14da2a062fa0",
                                                "text": "Such comments needlessly and irretrievably polarize the collective and its neighbors."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0e96a46b-3df3-4d34-a230-cdf49a599984",
                        "source_entry_id": "be683e81-633b-38d6-87f1-895988d67dd2",
                        "source_sense_id": "c540cde7-630e-3d91-ba75-f6fdaf725f79",
                        "target_lang_word": "irreversibly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "irreversibly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bf8b4b75-f96e-3a90-aeb8-00693bc8145e",
                                        "entry_id": "51efac20-f606-39e0-8f07-8ebe2a0fb49d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In an irreversible manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4657c5b8-8c52-4d95-b57e-d256bc7e4e93",
                                                "sense_id": "bf8b4b75-f96e-3a90-aeb8-00693bc8145e",
                                                "text": "But almost always such words are irreversibly established before the objectors learn of their existence, and the objections are hardly more than academic exercises."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d540abbf-60b2-4b4d-a27d-787423f1262f",
                                                "sense_id": "bf8b4b75-f96e-3a90-aeb8-00693bc8145e",
                                                "text": "We also perform IR-VIS absorbance measurements and find that the results suggest that during irradiation some of the dye molecules form dimers and trimers and that the polymer host is irreversibly damaged by photooxidation and Norrish type I photocleavage."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7b7c6379-ff2e-4ef7-88ac-f9dfd3c86f10",
                        "source_entry_id": "be683e81-633b-38d6-87f1-895988d67dd2",
                        "source_sense_id": "c540cde7-630e-3d91-ba75-f6fdaf725f79",
                        "target_lang_word": "irreparably",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "irreparably",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1f8f6c7e-d3a9-3196-a178-6ea77a79d2c8",
                                        "entry_id": "f3b94970-0357-38c2-b4d4-0ce2624cac2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Such that it cannot be repaired."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79897c7c-8856-4413-bcb0-f64213149e36",
                                                "sense_id": "1f8f6c7e-d3a9-3196-a178-6ea77a79d2c8",
                                                "text": "The building was erected in two years, at the parochial expence, on the foundation of the former one, which was irreparably damaged by the hurricane of Auguſt, 1712."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "94a31027-a732-423a-b3f0-c01c6b7cdd52",
                        "source_entry_id": "be683e81-633b-38d6-87f1-895988d67dd2",
                        "source_sense_id": "c540cde7-630e-3d91-ba75-f6fdaf725f79",
                        "target_lang_word": "irréparablement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "irréparablement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "210f5b7b-ff6c-35e7-97f7-a0caee930c52",
                                        "entry_id": "b061ccf0-bce4-35b6-b090-60e6a530f8b6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "D’une manière irréparable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "141fd0c9-e81f-427e-a3c4-90892f37e253",
                                                "sense_id": "210f5b7b-ff6c-35e7-97f7-a0caee930c52",
                                                "text": "La tempête a irréparablement endommagé le manoir du Tertre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b6c4ddf-b4b4-4a87-b809-e67d6d59235e",
                                                "sense_id": "210f5b7b-ff6c-35e7-97f7-a0caee930c52",
                                                "text": "N’y avait-il pas quelque chose de pédant, d’irréparablement collégien dans cette ostentation des lectures qu’il avait faites ?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "354ca3c8-9463-41fc-b572-a145e86d16f6",
                        "source_entry_id": "be683e81-633b-38d6-87f1-895988d67dd2",
                        "source_sense_id": "c540cde7-630e-3d91-ba75-f6fdaf725f79",
                        "target_lang_word": "irrémédiablement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "irrémédiablement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0689b2d7-4bb6-3883-bcac-a741d7da03fe",
                                        "entry_id": "250fda48-af83-3d30-8ee9-92300342284f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "D’une manière irrémédiable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7de9a6b-eee1-4bcb-80e0-e928c3f1fc58",
                                                "sense_id": "0689b2d7-4bb6-3883-bcac-a741d7da03fe",
                                                "text": "Qui nous donnera le droit de les regarder comme irrémédiablement méchants ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91e2871e-6c84-4724-bdc1-258d31176895",
                                                "sense_id": "0689b2d7-4bb6-3883-bcac-a741d7da03fe",
                                                "text": "[…] il serait délicat d'insister sur l'apparence regrettable qu'ont prise certains visages féminin qui ont été trop longtemps exposés aux attaques des fards ; ceux-ci ont pu à un certain moment donner un éclat particulier au visage, mais ils l'ont souvent irrémédiablement flétri."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b92a8a3b-2bd5-4cde-81ab-c38cadcd45f8",
                                                "sense_id": "0689b2d7-4bb6-3883-bcac-a741d7da03fe",
                                                "text": "Comme le visage d’une femme encore belle, et pourtant irrémédiablement vieillie, que fait soudain craquer l’éclairage funèbre du petit matin, le visage d’Orsenna m’avouait sa fatigue."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d0ce366e-63f2-4272-aae5-e56a7a3a83d8",
                                                "sense_id": "0689b2d7-4bb6-3883-bcac-a741d7da03fe",
                                                "text": "En dehors des buttes de Hautil et du marais de Buthiers, où ses habitats ont été irrémédiablement transformés, le piment royal se maintient relativement bien dans le massif de Rambouillet, son fief historique, où son abondance locale est parfois traduite dans la toponymie (pimentière)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d978eb3c-a900-484d-b769-992ac495daaa",
                                                "sense_id": "0689b2d7-4bb6-3883-bcac-a741d7da03fe",
                                                "text": "La dérive devint plus lente, mais elle nous conduisait irrémédiablement à terre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1ebb4fb-dfd1-4bf8-8f59-f23b0392a998",
                                                "sense_id": "0689b2d7-4bb6-3883-bcac-a741d7da03fe",
                                                "text": "Car enfin, n'est-ce pas là, dans ce cimetière des vanités, entre cartes postales et bibelots que s'achève irrémédiablement toute comédie littéraire ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "faba2f12-244c-43a9-bb5d-940b91259769",
                                                "sense_id": "0689b2d7-4bb6-3883-bcac-a741d7da03fe",
                                                "text": "De la même manière que Edward Saïd a soutenu que l’Orient n’existait qu’à travers l’orientalisme occidental, ils pensent que l’Afrique est la grande hétérotopie de l’Occident, son fantasme pour loger l’alter ego irrémédiablement autre."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "227a346a-ff98-434a-897f-a56cec521b02",
                        "source_entry_id": "be683e81-633b-38d6-87f1-895988d67dd2",
                        "source_sense_id": "c540cde7-630e-3d91-ba75-f6fdaf725f79",
